  (text "Any 4S LiPo / Li-ion hobby pack with a JST-XH 2.5 mm 5-pin balance plug (XT60 lead unused).  Balancer per cell: HY2213 OUT drives an AO3400A that bleeds the cell" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4fa953fd-f84b-5287-944b-1436a41e9da1"))
  (text "through 100 R (42 mA, 0.18 W) above 4.200 V, off at 4.19 V; 2.5 uA standing.  With the charger's 16.8 V this is the balance.  Pack B's negative is the 0 V output node." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 17.78 114.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "0f6ec460-3edf-5029-8a7b-8bcbc39e095d"))
