  (text "J1 / U4: the CH224A asks a PD brick for 20 V (R24 120k on CFG1).  Q13 passes VBUS to the charger only while Q12 sees +CHGB (toggle in" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 535.94 287.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "31393018-f5e6-581e-8c1c-97ee206b829f"))
  (text "CHARGE); a brick plugged in while RUN or OFF does nothing.  U5: buck at 300 kHz, Q6 switch, D7 blocks the packs from the input, D8 freewheels," (exclude_from_sim no) (at 535.94 292.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "39f3d925-66e1-5678-b651-20d117229046"))
  (text "L1 22 uH, R25 + R26 = 0.2 R -> 1 A constant current shared by the two packs in parallel (F3), 16.8 V +-1 % constant voltage, termination at" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 535.94 297.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "1bfa7ca8-284b-5e63-ae2f-c1d952b628a5"))
  (text "9 % (92 mA), trickle at 150 mA below 11.2 V, re-charge below 16.0 V, over-voltage cut at 18.1 V.  RT1 10k NTC (board temperature; a 10k" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 535.94 302.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "86cd8f1f-f684-5e9d-9ddb-09c13a4f6332"))
  (text "resistor disables it).  D9 CHRG (red), D10 DONE (green).  All of it on GND = pack A negative = the USB-C shell." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 535.94 307.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "36dc14ab-9b21-5339-9359-8d80910471cb"))
